m. Rendered as painted in casein: the matte velvety surface of this milk-protein binder carrying quick-drying opaque colour, soft diffused edges and a muted earthy palette, the re-emulsifiable texture allowing reworking, the traditional illustration medium of mid-century American painting. Lit by golden-hour sunlight falling low from the side - long crisp shadows, rim-lit edges glowing amber-orange against softened warm highlights, the whole scene wrapped in the last deep light of the afternoon. By Kent Williams, painterly comic art with noir atmosphere, muted colour palette, textured brushwork and cinematic composition."],"widgets_values_named":{"text_0":"Cosplaying as Superman (DC): a tall anthropomorphic sloth hybrid with an athletic build. He has a sloth's round, sleepy face with a blunt muzzle, small dark half-lidded eyes, a tawny beige coat of coarse shaggy fur, long, slow-moving arms, three-clawed hooked hands, stout clawed feet, and a faint algae-green tint to the fur. He has a very fit physique with slightly narrow shoulders, a flat chest, a defined waist, rounded hips, a thick neck, and rigid posture. He wears a skintight blue bodysuit with a large red and yellow diamond S shield on the chest, a red cape, red briefs, red boots, a golden belt, and a single curl of hair falling on the forehead. He is sitting relaxed. His expression is serene and set in a university dormitory room. Rendered as painted in casein: the matte velvety surface of this milk-protein binder carrying quick-drying opaque colour, soft diffused edges and a muted earthy palette, the re-emulsifiable texture allowing reworking, the traditional illustration medium of mid-century American painting. Lit by golden-hour sunlight falling low from the side - long crisp shadows, rim-lit edges glowing amber-orange against softened warm highlights, the whole scene wrapped in the last deep light of the afternoon. By Kent Williams, painterly comic art with noir atmosphere, muted colour palette, textured brushwork and cinematic composition."},"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":19,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1370,-230],"size":[300,110],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"📐 Image Size","properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 📐 Image Size\n\n👇 Set the image size (width / height / batch) here."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"### 📐 Image Size\n\n👇 Set the image size (width / height / batch) here."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":20,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1010,-230],"size":[300,110],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"🧠 Models","properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 🧠 Models\n\n👇 Swap models here to change the whole look."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"### 🧠 Models\n\n👇 Swap models here to change the whole look."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":21,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[680,-250],"size":[450,180],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"✍️ Prompts and Style Selection","properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### ✍️ Prompts\n\n✍️ Enter prompt text in the Stylebook Style node, and it will be automatically enhanced.\n\nModels with CFG1 (like Krea) will not actually use negatives, but the connection is shown here for illustrative purposes.\n\nYou can manually pick any style/artist/modifier (or randomize, or mix and match as you please!). Check out the galleries/references!"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"### ✍️ Prompts\n\n✍️ Enter prompt text in the Stylebook Style node, and it will be automatically enhanced.\n\nModels with CFG1 (like Krea) will not actually use negatives, but the connection is shown here for illustrative purposes.\n\nYou can manually pick any style/artist/modifier (or randomize, or mix and match as you please!). Check out the galleries/references!"},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":22,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2210,-230],"size":[380,190],"flags":{},"o